- **Opt-in** — `notify` can only become true after `Notification.requestPermission()` returns `granted`; create/update/toggle all clamp against it, stale grants are re-checked on load, denied/unsupported degrades to a plain line + disabled switch. An honest user-triggered `showCuePreview` fires one real `Notification` to prove the wiring (not a mock); background delivery documented as the native layer's job.

